1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:06,050
November 1950. At the Chosin Reservoir,
the 1st Marine Division is surrounded,

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,653
at thirty below.

3
00:00:07,743 --> 00:00:12,703
The only road out runs through Toktong
Pass. Fox Company holds it for five

4
00:00:12,753 --> 00:00:17,178
nights. Of two hundred and twenty
men, eighty-two walk off that hill.

5
00:00:17,198 --> 00:00:21,748
To reach them, Ray Davis leads his
battalion eight miles over frozen ridges,

6
00:00:21,798 --> 00:00:26,971
at night, in a snowstorm. He carries
out every one of his wounded.

7
00:00:27,041 --> 00:00:30,991
At Hagaru-ri, engineers cut
an airstrip under fire.

8
00:00:31,041 --> 00:00:33,552
More than four thousand
wounded are flown out.

9
00:00:33,572 --> 00:00:36,722
The dead they can't carry,
they bury at Koto-ri.

10
00:00:36,772 --> 00:00:39,982
Then the division fights
seventy-eight miles to the sea,

11
00:00:40,032 --> 00:00:40,660
together.

12
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:44,741
Bring your people home.
Nobody gets left behind.

13
00:00:45,021 --> 00:00:46,669
Semper Fidelis.
